<view class="page" wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="hero brand-hero"><view class="title">{{detail.session.title}}</view><view>{{detail.session.date}} {{detail.session.time}}</view></view><view class="notice">单节课只记录训练主题、训练重点和必要备注；现场训练细节由教练专业判断。</view><view class="card"><view class="field" wx:if="{{weeklyPlans.length}}"><text class="field-label">所属周训练计划</text><picker range="{{weeklyPlans}}" range-key="mainTheme" value="{{weeklyIndex}}" bindchange="weekly"><view class="picker">{{weeklyPlans[weeklyIndex].className}} · {{weeklyPlans[weeklyIndex].mainTheme}}</view></picker></view><view class="field" wx:else><text class="field-label">所属周训练计划</text><view class="muted">该班级暂未制定周计划，可先填写本节训练重点。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">从大纲选择训练主题</text><picker range="{{topics}}" range-key="name" value="{{topicIndex}}" bindchange="topic"><view class="picker">{{topics[topicIndex].name}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">训练主题（允许自定义）</text><input class="input" value="{{form.trainingTheme}}" data-key="trainingTheme" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">训练重点</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.trainingFocusText}}" placeholder="如：变向 / 加速 / 突破后的射门" data-key="trainingFocusText" bindinput="field"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">本节训练备注（内部选填）</text><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.trainingNote}}" placeholder="如：整体完成较好，下节继续加强突破后的处理。" data-key="trainingNote" bindinput="field"/></view></view><button class="btn-primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存本节训练重点</button></view>
